sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Demo user
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Data as Data adapter
  participant Privacy as Privacy guard
  participant Rules as Rules
  participant Jev as Jev optional
  participant Memory as Memory policy
  participant BB as Backboard optional

  User->>UI: Open transaction dashboard
  UI->>API: GET /api/v1/transactions
  API->>Data: list_transactions(server identity)
  alt Nessie live and healthy
    Data-->>API: Canonical sandbox context / transactions
  else Synthetic default or fallback
    Data-->>API: Deterministic synthetic transactions
  end
  API-->>UI: Transactions with source labels

  User->>UI: Open duplicate candidate
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/analyses {transaction_id}
  API->>Data: get transaction + safe history
  API->>Privacy: build safe-ai-payload-v1
  Privacy-->>API: safe payload + inspector actions
  API->>Rules: analyze safe features
  Rules-->>API: evidence + baseline classification
  opt Jev configured and healthy
    API->>Jev: POST /api/v1/systemone/ with safe payload
    Jev-->>API: bounded answers + probabilities + model version
  end
  API-->>UI: Analysis + provider mode

  User->>UI: View Privacy Inspector
  UI->>API: GET /api/v1/privacy/preview/{transaction_id}
  API-->>UI: Exact safe payload + field actions

  User->>UI: Confirm normal/review and consent flag
  UI->>API: POST /alerts/{alert_id}/confirmations
  API->>API: Verify server identity, ownership, idempotency
  API->>Memory: Evaluate memory write gate
  alt Consent false or policy disabled
    Memory-->>API: not-requested / skipped
  else Consent true and safe
    Memory->>BB: Add sanitized abstract memory
    BB-->>Memory: written or async pending
    Memory-->>API: safe memory status
  end
  API-->>UI: Confirmation preserved + memory status
  UI-->>User: Human-readable result and delete control

